                                           style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6;">Ten Wellness
                                            Born in the heart of Kuwait, Ten Wellness is the Arab world’s highest Google-rated spa — a space that not only combines exceptional techniques and therapeutic treatments
                                            <a
                                                    href="/aboutus"
